# Pull requests

Follow `AGENTS.md`.

Do not commit, push, or merge to `main`. Finish every change with a pull request from **this checkout**: commit, `git push`, `gh pr create`. Leave the PR open for review.

Do not spawn a Cursor cloud agent to re-commit the same change and open the PR. If `git push` or `gh` fails here, give the user the commands to run locally.

The GitHub PR branch name must match the local branch name (`git push` with `push.autosetupremote` does that).
